                from XXEBA_SALES_ORDER where  SALES_REP=:USER_ID and STATUS = 'R' AND TRUNC(UPDATED) > TRUNC(SYSDATE-3);
                if :P2000_SO_REJECTED_COUNT > 0 then 
                return :P2000_SO_REJECTED_COUNT;
                else 
                return null;
                end if;
                end;
                ```
